    "updated_at": "2021-12-14T21:07:57Z",
    "body": "Note that since `structuredClone()` does nothing with user activation, and #3414 renamed the `PostMessageOptions` dictionary to `StructuredCloneOptions`, in https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3245334 we decided to bring back the old dictionary name to keep the difference. See dtapuska/useractivation#15.",
